  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH plugin ecosystem added 71 new plugins and 338 stars to official repos, with 522,057 npm weekly downloads; dataelement/dsh-desktop led growth at +219 stars as the official repo shipped 0.2.0-rc.2. However, 13,130 of 17,147 non-fork plugins have been stale for 7+ days and the health score sits at 44, so activity concentration is worth watching.",
    "zh": "过去 8 小时生态新增 <b>71</b> 个插件，官方仓库涨 <b>338</b> 颗星，npm 周下载量 <b>522057</b>；增长榜由 dataelement/dsh-desktop 领跑（+<b>219</b> 星），官方同步放出 0.2.0-rc.2。不过 <b>17147</b> 个非 fork 插件里有 <b>13130</b> 个已 7 天无更新，健康分仅 <b>44</b>，建议持续观察活跃度分化。"
